      "text": "Dropbox",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dropbox",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "foJPHqd1FacElBx9TZflF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1489.7222892898083,
      "y": 14603.992253672151,
      "width": 1272.4371337890625,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFg",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1657496558,
      "version": 475,
      "versionNonce": 1860284082,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788169136409,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dropbox is a cloud based file storage service that allows users to store and share files.\nIt provides a secure and reliable way to store and access files from anywhere, on any device.\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dropbox is a cloud based file storage service that allows users to store and share files.\nIt provides a secure and reliable way to store and access files from anywhere, on any device.\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mukb2-Tvfu3Yt6K7MvTka",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1197.829971759842,
      "y": 15096.881071209586,
      "width": 744.5511474609375,
      "height": 1295,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFh",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 310441202,
      "version": 773,
      "versionNonce": 1762684338,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788168814920,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements \n\n- upload a file \n- download a file\n- automatically sync files across devices \n\nOut of scope \n- roll own blob storage \n\nNon-functional Requirements \n\n- Availability >> Consistency\n- low latency upload and download (as low as possible)\n- support large files as 50gb\n    - resumable uploads\n\n- high data integrity (sync accuracy ) \n\nCore Entities\n\n-> File(raw bytes)\n-> Filemetadata\n-> Users\n\nAPI\n\nPOST /file -> 200\nbody file & filemetadata & user id \n\nGET /files/:fileild -> file & filemetada\n\nGET /changes?since={timestamp} -> Filemetadatas []\n\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements \n\n- upload a file \n- download a file\n- automatically sync files across devices \n\nOut of scope \n- roll own blob storage \n\nNon-functional Requirements \n\n- Availability >> Consistency\n- low latency upload and download (as low as possible)\n- support large files as 50gb\n    - resumable uploads\n\n- high data integrity (sync accuracy ) \n\nCore Entities\n\n-> File(raw bytes)\n-> Filemetadata\n-> Users\n\nAPI\n\nPOST /file -> 200\nbody file & filemetadata & user id \n\nGET /files/:fileild -> file & filemetada\n\nGET /changes?since={timestamp} -> Filemetadatas []\n\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
