      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Remote change \n- pull for changes\n- download the new file and replace\n\n2. Local Change\n\n- upload the changed files to remote\n\nwindows API\n\n- filesystemwatcher\n\nmacos\n\n- FSEvents \n\n",
